summary.ko:
대사 진행기.
- {speaker, text} 대사와 선택지 / 라벨 / 점프로 이루어진 대본을 순서대로 해석한다.
  비주얼노벨 / RPG 대화 / 튜토리얼이 제각각 만들던 상태기계를 표준화했다.
- 대본 항목 형식:
    { speaker: "이름", text: "대사" }
    { label: "이름표" }
    { jump: "이름표" }
    { choice: [{ text: "보기", jump: "이름표" }, ...] }
    { end: true }
- 사용:
    runner.setScript(entries); runner.start();
    runner.getCurrent()   → { kind: "line" | "choice" | "finished", ... }
    대사에서 runner.advance(), 선택지에서 runner.choose(index).

summary.en:
Dialogue runner.
- Interprets in order a script made of {speaker, text} lines and choices / labels / jumps.
  Standardizes the state machine that visual novels / RPG dialogues / tutorials each built.
- Script entry format:
    { speaker: "name", text: "line" }
    { label: "tag" }
    { jump: "tag" }
    { choice: [{ text: "option", jump: "tag" }, ...] }
    { end: true }
- Usage:
    runner.setScript(entries); runner.start();
    runner.getCurrent()   → { kind: "line" | "choice" | "finished", ... }
    runner.advance() on a line, runner.choose(index) on a choice.

examples.code:
import { DialogueRunner } from "./build/vanilla.js";

const dialogueRunner = new DialogueRunner();
dialogueRunner.setScript([
	{ speaker: "Guide", text: "Welcome, traveler." },
	{ choice: [{ text: "Tell me more", jump: "more" }, { text: "Bye", jump: "bye" }] },
	{ label: "more" },
	{ speaker: "Guide", text: "This village is old." },
	{ end: true },
	{ label: "bye" },
	{ speaker: "Guide", text: "Safe travels." },
]);
dialogueRunner.start();
let current = dialogueRunner.getCurrent();
console.log(current.kind, current.speaker, current.text);

dialogueRunner.advance();
current = dialogueRunner.getCurrent();
console.log(current.kind, current.options.length);

dialogueRunner.choose(1);
current = dialogueRunner.getCurrent();
console.log(current.kind, current.text);

dialogueRunner.advance();
console.log(dialogueRunner.isFinished());

import { DialogueScriptParser, DialogueRunner } from "./build/vanilla.js";

const scriptText = [
	"/speaker Guide",
	"/say Welcome, traveler.",
	"Need a hand?",
	"/option Yes -> help",
	"/option No -> bye",
	"/label help",
	"/say Follow the river.",
	"/end",
	"/label bye",
	"/say Safe travels.",
].join("\n");
const entryList = DialogueScriptParser.parse(scriptText);
console.log(entryList.length);

const dialogueRunner = new DialogueRunner();
dialogueRunner.setScript(entryList);
dialogueRunner.start("help");
const current = dialogueRunner.getCurrent();
console.log(current.speaker, current.text);

summary.ko:
스프라이트 애니메이터 컴포넌트.
- 이름을 붙인 클립(프레임 시퀀스)을 등록해 두고 SpriteAnimator.play(node, "run") 이나 playClip("run") 으로 전환한다.
- 같은 클립을 다시 틀어도 재시작하지 않는다. (restartIfSame 옵션으로 바꿀 수 있다)
- 클립이 끝나면 onComplete 콜백으로 다음 상태를 이어 갈 수 있다. (FSM 과 결합)
- 같은 노드의 Sprite 컴포넌트에 현재 프레임(image + rect)을 반영한다.
- 사용:
    const animator = node.addComponent(SpriteAnimator);
    animator.addClip("idle", image, idleRects, 10, true);
    animator.addClip("attack", image, attackRects, 12, false);
    SpriteAnimator.play(node, "attack", { onComplete: () => animator.playClip("idle") });
- 두 엔진이 같은 꼴: 정적 SpriteAnimator.play(node, clipName, options) 가 노드의 애니메이터로 틀고, 애니메이터만 있을 때(완료 콜백 안)는 playClip 이다.
  (러스트 판 SpriteAnimator::play, play_clip)

summary.en:
Sprite animator component.
- Registers named clips (frame sequences) and switches with SpriteAnimator.play(node, "run") or playClip("run").
- Playing the same clip again does not restart it. (can be changed with the restartIfSame option)
- When a clip ends, the next state can follow via the onComplete callback. (combines with an FSM)
- Applies the current frame (image + rect) to the Sprite component on the same node.
- Usage:
    const animator = node.addComponent(SpriteAnimator);
    animator.addClip("idle", image, idleRects, 10, true);
    animator.addClip("attack", image, attackRects, 12, false);
    SpriteAnimator.play(node, "attack", { onComplete: () => animator.playClip("idle") });
- Same form in both engines: the static SpriteAnimator.play(node, clipName, options) plays with the node's animator, and playClip is for when only the animator is at hand (inside the complete callback).
  (the Rust SpriteAnimator::play, play_clip)

examples.code:
import { Engine, EngineConfiguration, Scene, WorldNode, Sprite, SpriteAnimator, ImageAsset, Rect, Vector2, Pivot } from "./build/vanilla.js";

const imageAsset = new ImageAsset();
await imageAsset.load("examples/assets/spritesheet.png");
const image = imageAsset.getImage();
const idleRects = [];
const attackRects = [];
for (let column = 0; column < 3; ++column) {
	idleRects.push(Rect.create(column * 200, 0, 200, 200));
	attackRects.push(Rect.create(column * 200, 200, 200, 200));
}

const characterNode = new WorldNode();
characterNode.addComponent(Sprite);
const spriteAnimator = characterNode.addComponent(SpriteAnimator);
spriteAnimator.addClip("idle", image, idleRects, 6, true);
spriteAnimator.addClip("attack", image, attackRects, 12, false);
spriteAnimator.playClip("idle");

class MainScene extends Scene {
	initialize(engine) {
		super.initialize(engine);
		characterNode.setPivot(Pivot.middleCenter);
		characterNode.setLocalPosition(Vector2.create(320, 180));
		characterNode.setContentSize(Vector2.create(200, 200));
		const root = this.getRoot();
		root.addChild(characterNode);
	}

	touchPress(viewInputPosition) {
		super.touchPress(viewInputPosition);
		spriteAnimator.playClip("attack", {
			onComplete: () => {
				spriteAnimator.playClip("idle");
			},
		});
	}
}

const engineConfiguration = new EngineConfiguration();
const engine = new Engine(engineConfiguration);
engine.run(new MainScene());

import { SpriteAnimator, ImageAsset } from "./build/vanilla.js";

const imageAsset = new ImageAsset();
await imageAsset.load("examples/assets/spritesheet.png");
const image = imageAsset.getImage();
const atlasJson = {
	frames: {
		"run_0": { frame: { x: 0, y: 400, w: 200, h: 200 } },
		"run_1": { frame: { x: 200, y: 400, w: 200, h: 200 } },
		"run_2": { frame: { x: 400, y: 400, w: 200, h: 200 } },
	},
};
const spriteAnimator = new SpriteAnimator();
spriteAnimator.addClipFromAtlas("run", image, atlasJson, ["run_0", "run_1", "run_2"], 12, true);
console.log(spriteAnimator.hasClip("run"), spriteAnimator.playClip("run"));
spriteAnimator.tick(0.1);
console.log(spriteAnimator.getClipName(), spriteAnimator.getCurrentFrameIndex());

summary.ko:
플랫포머 물리 컴포넌트.
- 중력 적분 + 바닥 접지 + 좌우 이동 경계처럼 횡스크롤 게임이 재발명하던
  최소 물리(운동학)를 담는다. 노드의 로컬 위치를 직접 움직인다.
- 사용:
    const body = node.addComponent(PlatformerBody);
    body.setGroundY(560);
    body.setHorizontalBounds(40, 920);
    // 이동: body.setVelocityX(±speed), 도약: body.jump(-720)

summary.en:
Platformer physics component.
- Holds the minimal physics (kinematics) that side-scrollers kept reinventing, such as gravity integration + ground contact +
  horizontal movement bounds. Moves the node's local position directly.
- Usage:
    const body = node.addComponent(PlatformerBody);
    body.setGroundY(560);
    body.setHorizontalBounds(40, 920);
    // move: body.setVelocityX(±speed), jump: body.jump(-720)

examples.code:
import { Engine, EngineConfiguration, Scene, WorldNode, Paint, PlatformerBody, Vector2, Pivot } from "./build/vanilla.js";

const playerNode = new WorldNode();
const paint = playerNode.addComponent(Paint);
paint.setColor("#ffcc00");
const platformerBody = playerNode.addComponent(PlatformerBody);
platformerBody.setGroundY(300);
platformerBody.setHorizontalBounds(40, 600);
platformerBody.setVelocityX(120);
platformerBody.setLandedEvent(() => {
	console.log("landed");
});

class MainScene extends Scene {
	initialize(engine) {
		super.initialize(engine);
		playerNode.setPivot(Pivot.bottomCenter);
		playerNode.setLocalPosition(Vector2.create(80, 100));
		playerNode.setContentSize(Vector2.create(32, 48));
		const root = this.getRoot();
		root.addChild(playerNode);
	}

	touchPress(viewInputPosition) {
		super.touchPress(viewInputPosition);
		platformerBody.jump(-720);
	}
}

const engineConfiguration = new EngineConfiguration();
const engine = new Engine(engineConfiguration);
engine.run(new MainScene());

import { WorldNode, PlatformerBody } from "./build/vanilla.js";

const node = new WorldNode();
const platformerBody = node.addComponent(PlatformerBody);
platformerBody.setGroundY(0);
platformerBody.tick(1 / 60);
console.log(platformerBody.isGrounded(), platformerBody.jump(-600));
let highestY = 0;
for (let frame = 0; frame < 60; ++frame) {
	platformerBody.tick(1 / 60);
	const position = node.getLocalPosition();
	highestY = Math.min(highestY, position.y);
}
console.log(highestY.toFixed(1), platformerBody.isGrounded());

summary.ko:
떠오르는 텍스트 관리 노드. (데미지 숫자 / +코인 등)
- spawn() 으로 띄우면 위로 떠오르며 사라진다. 끝난 라벨 노드는 재사용한다.
- 씬 뿌리에 addChild 해 두고 월드 좌표로 띄운다.
- 사용:
    const floatingText = new FloatingText();
    scene.getRoot().addChild(floatingText);
    floatingText.spawn("-120", position, { color: new Color(1, 0.4, 0.4, 1) });

summary.en:
Floating text manager node. (damage numbers / +coins, etc.)
- Text shown with spawn() floats upward and fades out. Finished label nodes are reused.
- Add it to the scene root with addChild and spawn in world coordinates.
- Usage:
    const floatingText = new FloatingText();
    scene.getRoot().addChild(floatingText);
    floatingText.spawn("-120", position, { color: new Color(1, 0.4, 0.4, 1) });

examples.code:
import { Engine, EngineConfiguration, Scene, FloatingText, Vector2, Color } from "./build/vanilla.js";

const floatingText = new FloatingText();

class MainScene extends Scene {
	initialize(engine) {
		super.initialize(engine);
		const root = this.getRoot();
		root.addChild(floatingText);
		floatingText.spawn("-120", Vector2.create(320, 180), { color: new Color(1, 0.4, 0.4, 1) });
		floatingText.spawn("+5", Vector2.create(200, 220), { fontSize: 30, duration: 1.2, jitter: 0 });
		console.log(floatingText.getActiveCount());
	}

	touchPress(viewInputPosition) {
		super.touchPress(viewInputPosition);
		floatingText.spawn("+1", viewInputPosition);
	}
}

