summary.ko:
트레일 렌더러.
- 노드가 지나간 자리를 점으로 기록해 굵기 / 색이 잦아드는 띠로 그린다.
  (유니티 TrailRenderer 의 2D 대응)
- 사용:
    const trail = node.addComponent(TrailRenderer);
    trail.setTime(0.5);
    trail.setWidth(14, 0);
    trail.setColors(new Color(0.4, 0.8, 1, 0.9), new Color(0.4, 0.8, 1, 0));

summary.en:
Trail renderer.
- Records the path the node has passed as points and draws it as a band whose width / color fade out.
  (2D counterpart of Unity's TrailRenderer)
- Usage:
    const trail = node.addComponent(TrailRenderer);
    trail.setTime(0.5);
    trail.setWidth(14, 0);
    trail.setColors(new Color(0.4, 0.8, 1, 0.9), new Color(0.4, 0.8, 1, 0));

examples.code:
