summary.ko:
화면 효과. (씬 후처리 사슬)
- 씬은 화면에 그대로 그리고, end() 에서 화면(또는 setRegion 으로 정한 영역)을 떠 와 켜진 효과를 차례로 건 뒤 같은 자리에 되돌려 놓는다.
- 영역은 캔버스 픽셀 좌표(왼쪽 위 원점)이며 둥근 모서리 반지름을 주면 그 바깥은 원본을 유지한다.
- 사용:
    // 씬 load 에서
    this.screenEffect = new ScreenEffect(engine.getGraphic());
    this.screenEffect.setEnabled(ScreenEffectType.vignette, true);
    // preDraw 처음 / postDraw 끝에서
    this.screenEffect.begin(graphic);  ...  this.screenEffect.end(graphic);
    // tick 에서
    this.screenEffect.tick(timeDelta);

summary.en:
Screen effect. (scene post-processing chain)
- The scene draws to the screen as is, and end() captures the screen (or the region set with setRegion), applies the enabled effects in order, and puts it back in the same place.
- The region is in canvas pixel coordinates (top-left origin), and if a rounded corner radius is given, the original is kept outside it.
- Usage:
    // in the scene's load
    this.screenEffect = new ScreenEffect(engine.getGraphic());
    this.screenEffect.setEnabled(ScreenEffectType.vignette, true);
    // at the start of preDraw / the end of postDraw
    this.screenEffect.begin(graphic);  ...  this.screenEffect.end(graphic);
    // in tick
    this.screenEffect.tick(timeDelta);

examples.code:
import { Engine, EngineConfiguration, Scene, ScreenEffect, ScreenEffectType, Color, Colors, Rect } from "./build/vanilla.js";

class MainScene extends Scene {
	initialize(engine) {
		super.initialize(engine);
		const graphic = engine.getGraphic();
		this.screenEffect = new ScreenEffect(graphic);
		this.screenEffect.setRegion(40, 20, 560, 320, 24);
		this.screenEffect.setEnabled(ScreenEffectType.vignette, true);
		this.screenEffect.setColor(ScreenEffectType.vignette, new Color(0.1, 0, 0.2, 1));
		this.screenEffect.setEnabled(ScreenEffectType.chromatic, true);
		this.screenEffect.setStrength(ScreenEffectType.chromatic, 0.5);
	}

	tick(timeDelta) {
		super.tick(timeDelta);
		this.screenEffect.tick(timeDelta);
	}

	preDraw(graphic) {
		super.preDraw(graphic);
		this.screenEffect.begin(graphic);
		graphic.setFillColor(Colors.white);
		graphic.drawRect(Rect.create(220, 100, 200, 160));
	}

	postDraw(graphic) {
		super.postDraw(graphic);
		this.screenEffect.end(graphic);
	}
}

const engineConfiguration = new EngineConfiguration();
const engine = new Engine(engineConfiguration);
engine.run(new MainScene());

import { Engine, EngineConfiguration, ScreenEffect, ScreenEffectType } from "./build/vanilla.js";

const engineConfiguration = new EngineConfiguration();
