summary.ko:
컨텍스트 메뉴. (우클릭 / 길게 누름 메뉴)
- show(position, itemList) 로 항목 목록을 그 자리에 띄운다.
  바깥을 누르면 닫히고, 항목을 누르면 처리기를 부르고 닫힌다.
- 씬 뿌리의 맨 위(마지막 자식)에 addChild 해 두고 쓴다.
- 사용:
    const contextMenu = new UIContextMenu();
    scene.getRoot().addChild(contextMenu);
    contextMenu.show(viewPosition, [
        { text: "복사", handler: () => {} },
        { text: "삭제", handler: () => {} },
    ]);

summary.en:
Context menu. (right-click / long-press menu)
- show(position, itemList) pops up the item list at that position.
  Pressing outside closes it, and pressing an item calls its handler and closes it.
- addChild it at the top (last child) of the scene root before use.
- Usage:
    const contextMenu = new UIContextMenu();
    scene.getRoot().addChild(contextMenu);
    contextMenu.show(viewPosition, [
        { text: "Copy", handler: () => {} },
        { text: "Delete", handler: () => {} },
    ]);

examples.code:
import { Engine, EngineConfiguration, UIScene, UIContextMenu, Color, Vector2 } from "./build/vanilla.js";

class ContextMenuScene extends UIScene {
	create() {
		super.create();
		const contextMenu = new UIContextMenu({ menuWidth: 180, fontSize: 13, panelColor: new Color(0.1, 0.12, 0.18, 1) });
		const root = this.getRoot();
		root.addChild(contextMenu);
		contextMenu.show(Vector2.create(200, 120), [
			{ text: "Copy", handler: () => {
				console.log("copy");
			} },
			{ text: "Paste", isDisabled: true },
			{ text: "Delete", handler: () => {
				console.log("delete");
			} },
		]);
	}
}

const engineConfiguration = new EngineConfiguration();
const engine = new Engine(engineConfiguration);
const scene = new ContextMenuScene();
scene.setLoadingMinDurationMs(0);
engine.run(scene);

summary.ko:
드래그 가능 컴포넌트.
- 노드에 붙이면 눌러서 끌 수 있다. 놓으면 dragEndEvent 로 알리고,
  setSnapBackEnabled(true) 면 잡기 전 자리로 미끄러져 돌아간다.
- 이동량은 뷰 좌표 차분을 그대로 로컬 좌표에 더한다.
  (조상 노드에 배율이 있으면 감도가 달라질 수 있다)
- 사용:
    const draggable = cardNode.addComponent(UIDraggable);
    draggable.setSnapBackEnabled(true);
    draggable.setDragEndEvent((self, viewPosition) => { ... });

summary.en:
Draggable component.
- Attached to a node, it can be pressed and dragged. On release it notifies via dragEndEvent, and
  if setSnapBackEnabled(true), it slides back to where it was before being grabbed.
- The movement adds the view coordinate delta directly to the local position.
  (sensitivity may differ if an ancestor node has a scale)
- Usage:
    const draggable = cardNode.addComponent(UIDraggable);
    draggable.setSnapBackEnabled(true);
    draggable.setDragEndEvent((self, viewPosition) => { ... });

examples.code:
import { Engine, EngineConfiguration, UIScene, UIDraggable, WorldNode, Paint, Color, Pivot, Vector2 } from "./build/vanilla.js";

class DragScene extends UIScene {
	create() {
		super.create();
		const root = this.getRoot();

		const slotNode = new WorldNode();
		slotNode.setPivot(Pivot.topLeft.clone());
		slotNode.setAnchor(Pivot.topLeft.clone());
		slotNode.setContentSize(Vector2.create(140, 100));
		slotNode.setLocalPosition(Vector2.create(420, 130));
		const slotPaint = slotNode.addComponent(Paint);
		slotPaint.setColor(new Color(1, 1, 1, 0.1));
		root.addChild(slotNode);

		const cardNode = new WorldNode();
		cardNode.setPivot(Pivot.topLeft.clone());
		cardNode.setAnchor(Pivot.topLeft.clone());
		cardNode.setContentSize(Vector2.create(120, 80));
		cardNode.setLocalPosition(Vector2.create(80, 140));
		const cardPaint = cardNode.addComponent(Paint);
		cardPaint.setColor(new Color(0.36, 0.42, 1, 1));
		cardPaint.setRoundSize(8);
		const draggable = cardNode.addComponent(UIDraggable);
		draggable.setSnapBackEnabled(true);
		draggable.setDragEndEvent((self, viewPosition) => {
			if (slotNode.contains(viewPosition)) {
				self.settleHere();
			}
		});
		root.addChild(cardNode);
	}
}

const engineConfiguration = new EngineConfiguration();
const engine = new Engine(engineConfiguration);
const scene = new DragScene();
scene.setLoadingMinDurationMs(0);
engine.run(scene);

import { UIDraggable, WorldNode, Vector2 } from "./build/vanilla.js";

const cardNode = new WorldNode();
cardNode.setLocalPosition(Vector2.create(100, 100));
const draggable = cardNode.addComponent(UIDraggable);
draggable.setSnapBackEnabled(true);
draggable.setDragEndEvent((self, viewPosition) => {
	if (viewPosition.x > 320) {
		self.settleHere();
	}
});
draggable.touchPress(Vector2.create(110, 110));
draggable.touchMove(Vector2.create(160, 120));
draggable.touchRelease(Vector2.create(160, 120));
draggable.tick(1);
const localPosition = cardNode.getLocalPosition();
console.log(localPosition.x, localPosition.y);

summary.ko:
회전 로딩 인디케이터.
- 원 둘레에 점 여러 개를 놓고 밝기가 꼬리처럼 돌아가는 표준 스피너.
- 사용:
    const spinner = new UISpinner({ radius: 9, dotCount: 10 });
    someNode.addChild(spinner);
    spinner.setLocalPosition(Vector2.create(x, y));

summary.en:
Spinning loading indicator.
- A standard spinner with several dots around a circle whose brightness rotates like a tail.
- Usage:
    const spinner = new UISpinner({ radius: 9, dotCount: 10 });
    someNode.addChild(spinner);
    spinner.setLocalPosition(Vector2.create(x, y));

examples.code:
