summary.ko:
토스트.
- show(message) 로 알약 모양 알림이 아래에서 떠올라 잠시 머문 뒤 사라진다.
- 여러 번 부르면 줄을 세워 하나씩 보여 준다. (여러 게임이 화면마다 복붙하던 패턴)
- 씬 뿌리의 맨 위(마지막 자식)에 addChild 해 두고 쓴다.
- 사용:
    const toast = new UIToast();
    scene.getRoot().addChild(toast);
    toast.show("저장되었습니다.");

summary.en:
Toast.
- show(message) makes a pill-shaped notification rise from the bottom, stay briefly, then disappear.
- Calling it several times queues them and shows them one by one. (a pattern several games copy-pasted per screen)
- addChild it at the top (last child) of the scene root before use.
- Usage:
    const toast = new UIToast();
    scene.getRoot().addChild(toast);
    toast.show("Saved.");

examples.code:
import { Engine, EngineConfiguration, UIScene, UIToast, Color } from "./build/vanilla.js";

class ToastScene extends UIScene {
	create() {
		super.create();
		const toast = new UIToast({ width: 320, height: 40, restY: 300, holdSeconds: 1.2, backgroundColor: new Color(0.07, 0.09, 0.13, 0.95) });
		const root = this.getRoot();
		root.addChild(toast);
		toast.show("Game saved");
		toast.show("Achievement unlocked");
		const isShowing = toast.isShowing();
		console.log(isShowing);
	}
}

const engineConfiguration = new EngineConfiguration();
const engine = new Engine(engineConfiguration);
const scene = new ToastScene();
scene.setLoadingMinDurationMs(0);
engine.run(scene);

import { Engine, EngineConfiguration, UIScene, UILabel, WorldNode, Paint, Color, Pivot, Vector2, attachToastMotion, readToastSeconds } from "./build/vanilla.js";

class ToastScene extends UIScene {
	create() {
		super.create();
		const toastNode = new WorldNode();
		toastNode.setPivot(Pivot.topLeft.clone());
		toastNode.setAnchor(Pivot.topLeft.clone());
		toastNode.setContentSize(Vector2.create(240, 40));
		toastNode.setLocalPosition(Vector2.create(200, 24));
		toastNode.setActive(false);
		const toastPaint = toastNode.addComponent(Paint);
		toastPaint.setColor(new Color(0.08, 0.1, 0.14, 0.95));
		toastPaint.setRoundSize(20);
		const toastLabel = toastNode.addComponent(UILabel);
		const toastMotion = attachToastMotion(toastNode, -1);
		const root = this.getRoot();
		root.addChild(toastNode);

		const text = "Game saved";
		const seconds = readToastSeconds(text, 1.5);
		toastMotion.show(text, seconds, () => {
			toastLabel.setText(text);
		});
	}
}

const engineConfiguration = new EngineConfiguration();
const engine = new Engine(engineConfiguration);
const scene = new ToastScene();
scene.setLoadingMinDurationMs(0);
engine.run(scene);

import { readToastSeconds } from "./build/vanilla.js";

const shortSeconds = readToastSeconds("Saved", 1.5);
const longSeconds = readToastSeconds("The cloud save finished uploading just now", 1.5);
const cappedSeconds = readToastSeconds("x".repeat(200), 1.5);
console.log(shortSeconds, longSeconds, cappedSeconds);

summary.ko:
확인 대화 상자.
- 어둡게 가리는 막 + 가운데 카드 + 확인 / 취소 단추를 한 번의 show() 로 띄운다.
  등장 / 퇴장은 PopupMotion(되튕김 확대 / 수축)으로 움직인다.
- 막을 누르면 취소로 처리한다. onCancel 을 넘기지 않으면 확인만 있는 알림이 된다.
- 씬 뿌리의 맨 위(마지막 자식)에 addChild 해 두고 쓴다.
- 사용:
    const dialog = new UIDialog();
    scene.getRoot().addChild(dialog);
    dialog.show("정말 삭제할까요?", { onConfirm: () => remove(), onCancel: () => {} });

summary.en:
Confirmation dialog.
- Pops up a darkening overlay + a centered card + confirm / cancel buttons with a single show().
  Entrance / exit animate with PopupMotion (bounce scale up / shrink).
- Pressing the overlay counts as cancel. If onCancel is not passed, it becomes a confirm-only alert.
- addChild it at the top (last child) of the scene root before use.
- Usage:
    const dialog = new UIDialog();
    scene.getRoot().addChild(dialog);
    dialog.show("Really delete?", { onConfirm: () => remove(), onCancel: () => {} });

examples.code:
import { Engine, EngineConfiguration, UIScene, UIDialog } from "./build/vanilla.js";

class DialogScene extends UIScene {
	initialize(engine) {
		super.initialize(engine);
		const dialog = new UIDialog({ width: 360, height: 200, confirmText: "Delete", cancelText: "Keep" });
		const root = this.getRoot();
		root.addChild(dialog);
		dialog.show("Delete this save file?", {
			onConfirm: () => {
				console.log("deleted");
			},
			onCancel: () => {
				console.log("kept");
			},
		});
	}
}

const engineConfiguration = new EngineConfiguration();
const engine = new Engine(engineConfiguration);
const scene = new DialogScene();
scene.setLoadingMinDurationMs(0);
engine.run(scene);

import { Engine, EngineConfiguration, Scene } from "./build/vanilla.js";

class MainScene extends Scene {
	initialize(engine) {
		const inputManager = engine.getInputManager();
		const inputActions = inputManager.getInputActions();
		inputActions.bindKey("confirm", "Enter");
		inputActions.bindKey("confirm", "Space");
		inputActions.bindGamepadButton("confirm", 0);
		inputActions.bindKey("down", "ArrowDown");
		inputActions.bindAxis("down", 1, 1);
		inputActions.setRepeat("down", 0.4, 0.1);
	}

	tick(timeDelta) {
		super.tick(timeDelta);
		const engine = this.getEngine();
		const inputManager = engine.getInputManager();
		const inputActions = inputManager.getInputActions();
		if (inputActions.isJustPressed("confirm")) {
			console.log("confirm");
		}
		if (inputActions.isJustPressed("down")) {
			console.log("next item");
		}
		const moveAxis = inputActions.readMoveAxis();
		if (moveAxis.x !== 0 || moveAxis.y !== 0) {
			console.log(moveAxis.x, moveAxis.y);
		}
	}
}

const engineConfiguration = new EngineConfiguration();
const engine = new Engine(engineConfiguration);
engine.run(new MainScene());

import { Engine, EngineConfiguration, GamepadKind } from "./build/vanilla.js";

const engineConfiguration = new EngineConfiguration();
const engine = new Engine(engineConfiguration);
const inputManager = engine.getInputManager();
const inputActions = inputManager.getInputActions();
inputActions.bindKey("confirm", "Enter");
const platformSource = {
	readActionValue(action) {
		if (action === "confirm") {
			return 1;
		}
		return 0;
	},
	readMoveAxis() {
		return { x: 0.5, y: 0 };
	},
	readGamepadKind() {
		return GamepadKind.xbox;
	},
};
inputActions.addSource(platformSource);
inputActions.update(inputManager, 0);
const moveAxis = inputActions.readMoveAxis();
const isConfirmPressed = inputActions.isPressed("confirm");
const lastInputDevice = inputManager.getLastInputDevice();
console.log(isConfirmPressed, moveAxis.x, lastInputDevice);
inputActions.removeSource(platformSource);

