description.en:
Passes a ribbon drawn only this frame. (A strip of a point sequence spread toward the camera)
  options: { points([[x, y, z], ...], two or more), width, taper(0 uniform width, 1 both ends 0), color, ramp, alpha, brightness, grainRepeat, flow,
             glow(glow color [r, g, b], if given covers with a white core, that color around it and rim-colored edges, otherwise additive light), rim(when there is no glow, fraction of the look that covers the body with the rim color and keeps the core in color, 0 additive light only) }

